at="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" id="ixv-397">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">Pre-commencement communications pursuant to Rule 14d-2(b) under the Exchange Act (17 CFR 240.14d-2(b))</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px"><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px"><ix:nonNumeric name="dei:PreCommencementIssuerTenderOffer" contextRef="From2026-08-10to2026-08-10" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" id="ixv-398">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">Pre-commencement communications pursuant to Rule 13e-4(c) under the Exchange Act (17 CFR 240.13e-4(c)) Securities registered pursuant to Section 12(b) of the Act:</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><table style="border-spacing:0;font-size:10pt;border-right:#000000 1px solid;border-bottom:#000000 1px solid;text-align:justify;width:100%" cellpadding="2"><tbody><tr style="height:15px"><td style="border-top:#000000 1px solid;border-left:#000000 1px solid;padding:2px;width:33%;vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Title of each class</strong></p></td><td style="border-top:#000000 1px solid;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;padding-left:2px;border-left:#000000 1px solid;padding-right:2px;padding:2px;vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Trading Symbol(s)</strong></p></td><td style="border-top:#000000 1px solid;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;padding-left:2px;border-left:#000000 1px solid;padding-right:2px;padding:2px;width:33%;vertical-align:top;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Name of